      "widgets_values": [
        "## Marigold V2 Tiled Depth - Vathography\n\nLoad a photograph in the **Photo** node, then run.\n\nThe depth map (0 to 1, near = bright, far = dark) is saved as a 32-bit EXR with the linear color space.\n\n**Official model source:** [Comfy-Org/marigold-v2-0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/marigold-v2-0)\n\nModels are placed in these directories, inside `ComfyUI/models/`:\n\n- diffusion_models/qwen_image_edit_2509_int8_convrot.safetensors\n- loras/marigold_v2_depth_log_stage2.safetensors\n- vae/marigold_v2_depth_log_stage2_vae.safetensors\n- embeddings/marigold_v2_depth_conditioning.safetensors\n\nLicense: AGPL-3.0-only. The \"Marigold V2 Tiled Depth - Vathography\" node has been released for free, and the depth maps it produces are free to use for commercial work.\n"
      ],
